<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury raises 70 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury raises 70 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday said it sold 70 million dinars of three-year notes at its weekly auction on October 29, repaying maturing paper totalling 45.7 million dinars.</p>
<p>The three-year notes payable in equal annual tranches were at a 9.0625 percent yield, unchanged from its level last week.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 185 million dinars of three-, four- and five-year notes at between 9.0625 and 9.5 percent. ($=0.98 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
